        {'t': 'p', 'text': 'Older properties in [Culver City](/service-area/culver-city-ca/) and [Venice](/service-area/venice-ca/) may have aging laterals, so a camera inspection can show a problem before a backup happens. Ask a plumber what your lateral material and age suggest, and keep any report on file with your records for later reference.'},
